body:
The selector `body.index .content .row a` is overly specific with 4 levels of nesting. Consider using a more targeted class-based selector instead. This would improve maintainability and reduce specificity, making it easier to override if needed in the future.
```suggestion
// NOTE: Add the `.post-list-link` class to anchor tags in the index/home page template for this style to apply.
.post-list-link {
```

