body:
There is code duplication between the two `SetBindingXBindProvider` methods. The new overload duplicates all the same assignments except for `XBindSourceType`. Consider having the new overload call the existing one and then set the additional property to reduce duplication and improve maintainability.

Example:
```csharp
internal void SetBindingXBindProvider(object compiledSource, Func<object, (bool, object)> xBindSelector, Action<object, object> xBindBack, Type sourceType, string[] propertyPaths = null)
{
    SetBindingXBindProvider(compiledSource, xBindSelector, xBindBack, propertyPaths);
    XBindSourceType = sourceType;
}
```
```suggestion
			SetBindingXBindProvider(compiledSource, xBindSelector, xBindBack, propertyPaths);
```

